496
00:48:05,550 --> 00:48:14,884
So if I changed any of the properties here from required to not required or vice versa, I would have to also do that in the bot form.

497
00:48:15,168 --> 00:48:24,608
But because we reuse the bot insert schema, which we defined once inside of our schema file, we never have to worry about drift again.

