00:55:09,040 --> 00:55:15,524
We do that with the concept of route groups, which is a feature Next.js, which is our framework, offers.

567
00:55:15,950 --> 00:55:19,920
It's a convention that lets us organize routes by category or team.

568
00:55:20,080 --> 00:55:22,468
