01:26:42,126 --> 01:26:44,416
In here, I can see what's actually happening.

899
01:26:44,526 --> 01:26:51,056
I'm going to take a screenshot of the deploy logs and I'm going to show it what actually happens when I load the page.

900
01:26:51,136 --> 01:26:56,176
And I'm going to tell the agent that even though deployment is successful, the page fails to load.

901
01:26:56,398 --> 01:26:58,436
And I'm going to provide it with both screenshots.

902
01:26:58,656 --> 01:27:00,496
Now try doing the following.

