01:28:02,496 --> 01:28:05,296
And then simply paste all of the keys here.

916
01:28:05,536 --> 01:28:10,176
What's important is that you have the AI SDK provider secrets in here.

917
01:28:10,256 --> 01:28:11,776
And then go ahead and save.

