01:29:18,574 --> 01:29:23,280
You can now also redeploy your environment variable change on Railway.

935
01:29:23,438 --> 01:29:24,400
So let's try this again.

936
01:29:24,560 --> 01:29:28,880
I just shut down my trigger server and I shut down my Next.js server.

937
01:29:28,960 --> 01:29:32,960
I am back in my production instance and I'm going to tell my agent hello world.

